{"cast":"nova","group":"game","bank":"game.5e7561b5ac.bin","lines":[{"id":"game.intro.ones.01","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Ones at Orbit! One on one, first to eleven, make it take it. Two hoopers, one court, zero gravity.","off":0,"len":28861,"sec":5.956},{"id":"game.intro.ones.02","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Mission briefing: one on one, first to eleven, and if you score, you keep the ball. Launch!","off":28861,"len":24595,"sec":4.825},{"id":"game.intro.threes.01","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Threes at Orbit! Three on three, first to twenty-one, and ninety seconds on the clock. Crew up!","off":53456,"len":26309,"sec":5.175},{"id":"game.intro.threes.02","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Full crew mission! Three a side, first to twenty-one, ninety-second clock. Mission control, start the countdown!","off":79765,"len":28608,"sec":5.896},{"id":"game.check.01","moment":"game.check","text":"Check ball. Shields up, cadet.","off":108373,"len":12559,"sec":1.798},{"id":"game.check.02","moment":"game.check","text":"Their ball. Guard your airspace.","off":120932,"len":12006,"sec":1.696},{"id":"game.check.03","moment":"game.check","text":"Defense! Hold the orbit!","off":132938,"len":10782,"sec":1.423},{"id":"game.check.04","moment":"game.check","text":"Ball checked. Protect the pad.","off":143720,"len":12320,"sec":1.713},{"id":"game.make.01","moment":"game.make","text":"Touchdown from midrange!","off":156040,"len":10850,"sec":1.423},{"id":"game.make.02","moment":"game.make","text":"Pull-up, and it lands!","off":166890,"len":10370,"sec":1.266},{"id":"game.make.03","moment":"game.make","text":"Smooth launch, clean landing!","off":177260,"len":11813,"sec":1.649},{"id":"game.make.04","moment":"game.make","text":"Jumper is good!","off":189073,"len":9273,"sec":1.072},{"id":"game.make.05","moment":"game.make","text":"Right on the flight path!","off":198346,"len":10722,"sec":1.403},{"id":"game.make.06","moment":"game.make","text":"Docked it, nice and smooth!","off":209068,"len":11703,"sec":1.585},{"id":"game.three.01","moment":"game.three","text":"From deep space! Three!","off":220771,"len":10778,"sec":1.426},{"id":"game.three.02","moment":"game.three","text":"Long-range launch, good!","off":231549,"len":10744,"sec":1.484},{"id":"game.three.03","moment":"game.three","text":"Outer ring, and it lands!","off":242293,"len":11193,"sec":1.446},{"id":"game.three.04","moment":"game.three","text":"Beyond the arc, beyond gravity!","off":253486,"len":12870,"sec":1.824},{"id":"game.three.05","moment":"game.three","text":"Satellite shot, it drops!","off":266356,"len":11508,"sec":1.606},{"id":"game.layup.01","moment":"game.layup","text":"Soft landing at the rim!","off":277864,"len":10898,"sec":1.39},{"id":"game.layup.02","moment":"game.layup","text":"Smooth re-entry, and in!","off":288762,"len":11218,"sec":1.465},{"id":"game.layup.03","moment":"game.layup","text":"Up and in, gentle docking!","off":299980,"len":11924,"sec":1.683},{"id":"game.layup.04","moment":"game.layup","text":"Easy touchdown inside!","off":311904,"len":11553,"sec":1.616},{"id":"game.dunk.01","moment":"game.dunk","text":"We have liftoff!","off":323457,"len":9428,"sec":1.046},{"id":"game.dunk.02","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Rocket to the rim!","off":332885,"len":9432,"sec":1.122},{"id":"game.dunk.03","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Ooh, full-power flush!","off":342317,"len":10764,"sec":1.401},{"id":"game.dunk.04","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Launched and landed!","off":353081,"len":9751,"sec":1.197},{"id":"game.dunk.05","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Altitude check: plenty!","off":362832,"len":11848,"sec":1.636},{"id":"game.poster.01","moment":"game.poster","text":"Posterized into orbit! Unreal!","off":374680,"len":13862,"sec":2.127},{"id":"game.poster.02","moment":"game.poster","text":"Eclipsed the defender completely!","off":388542,"len":12562,"sec":1.79},{"id":"game.poster.03","moment":"game.poster","text":"Cleared the defender! We have altitude!","off":401104,"len":14325,"sec":2.054},{"id":"game.poster.04","moment":"game.poster","text":"Defender turned launch pad! Whoa!","off":415429,"len":13085,"sec":1.922},{"id":"game.poster.05","moment":"game.poster","text":"Hang it next to the planet!","off":428514,"len":11203,"sec":1.465},{"id":"game.poster.06","moment":"game.poster","text":"Mission control, that was a poster!","off":439717,"len":12966,"sec":1.999},{"id":"game.andone.01","moment":"game.andone","text":"And one! Through the turbulence!","off":452683,"len":11812,"sec":1.63},{"id":"game.andone.02","moment":"game.andone","text":"Contact, and it still lands!","off":464495,"len":12094,"sec":1.663},{"id":"game.andone.03","moment":"game.andone","text":"Fouled, and it counts anyway!","off":476589,"len":11853,"sec":1.64},{"id":"game.andone.04","moment":"game.andone","text":"Extra fuel at the line!","off":488442,"len":10717,"sec":1.399},{"id":"game.miss.01","moment":"game.miss","text":"Off the rim.","off":499159,"len":8078,"sec":0.834},{"id":"game.miss.02","moment":"game.miss","text":"No landing there.","off":507237,"len":9327,"sec":1.082},{"id":"game.miss.03","moment":"game.miss","text":"Missed the docking.","off":516564,"len":9775,"sec":1.154},{"id":"game.miss.04","moment":"game.miss","text":"Drifted wide.","off":526339,"len":9197,"sec":1.018},{"id":"game.airball.01","moment":"game.airball","text":"Airball! Missed the whole planet!","off":535536,"len":11565,"sec":1.61},{"id":"game.airball.02","moment":"game.airball","text":"Off the radar entirely!","off":547101,"len":11567,"sec":1.576},{"id":"game.airball.03","moment":"game.airball","text":"Orbit saw that. Everybody did.","off":558668,"len":13012,"sec":1.94},{"id":"game.airball.04","moment":"game.airball","text":"Where was that headed? Mars?","off":571680,"len":12104,"sec":1.758},{"id":"game.block.01","moment":"game.block","text":"Launch denied!","off":583784,"len":9211,"sec":1.033},{"id":"game.block.02","moment":"game.block","text":"Rejected into deep space!","off":592995,"len":11613,"sec":1.645},{"id":"game.block.03","moment":"game.block","text":"Force field! Blocked!","off":604608,"len":10678,"sec":1.35},{"id":"game.block.04","moment":"game.block","text":"Sent right back to earth!","off":615286,"len":10796,"sec":1.419},{"id":"game.block.05","moment":"game.block","text":"No-fly zone!","off":626082,"len":9605,"sec":1.118},{"id":"game.block.06","moment":"game.block","text":"Asteroid deflected!","off":635687,"len":10852,"sec":1.404},{"id":"game.blocked.01","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Launch intercepted!","off":646539,"len":10442,"sec":1.29},{"id":"game.blocked.02","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Denied re-entry!","off":656981,"len":9763,"sec":1.226},{"id":"game.blocked.03","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Stuffed at the pad!","off":666744,"len":9490,"sec":1.075},{"id":"game.blocked.04","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Grounded by the defender!","off":676234,"len":11457,"sec":1.547},{"id":"game.steal.01","moment":"game.steal","text":"Intercepted! Signal captured!","off":687691,"len":12583,"sec":1.82},{"id":"game.steal.02","moment":"game.steal","text":"Picked clean out of orbit!","off":700274,"len":10851,"sec":1.394},{"id":"game.steal.03","moment":"game.steal","text":"Swiped! Change of mission!","off":711125,"len":11135,"sec":1.471},{"id":"game.steal.04","moment":"game.steal","text":"Cargo recovered!","off":722260,"len":9204,"sec":1.117},{"id":"game.steal.05","moment":"game.steal","text":"Tractor beam! Ball is yours!","off":731464,"len":12496,"sec":1.851},{"id":"game.stolen.01","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Cargo lost in transit!","off":743960,"len":11680,"sec":1.582},{"id":"game.stolen.02","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Stripped. Signal lost.","off":755640,"len":11030,"sec":1.448},{"id":"game.stolen.03","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Ball drifted away! Get back!","off":766670,"len":12147,"sec":1.736},{"id":"game.stolen.04","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Pickpocketed in zero gravity!","off":778817,"len":13195,"sec":1.923},{"id":"game.ankles.01","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Ankles lost in space!","off":792012,"len":11263,"sec":1.509},{"id":"game.ankles.02","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Crossover! Gravity took the defender!","off":803275,"len":13920,"sec":2.095},{"id":"game.ankles.03","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Whoa! Defender down, orbit wobbling!","off":817195,"len":13644,"sec":2.125},{"id":"game.ankles.04","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Shook them out of orbit!","off":830839,"len":10667,"sec":1.339},{"id":"game.ankles.05","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Ha! Who turned gravity up?","off":841506,"len":11427,"sec":1.586},{"id":"game.ankles.06","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Somebody help the defender up!","off":852933,"len":12251,"sec":1.759},{"id":"game.bite.01","moment":"game.bite","text":"Took the bait! Launched early!","off":865184,"len":11724,"sec":1.583},{"id":"game.bite.02","moment":"game.bite","text":"Fake launch! Defender bought it!","off":876908,"len":12301,"sec":1.736},{"id":"game.bite.03","moment":"game.bite","text":"Up went the defender!","off":889209,"len":10103,"sec":1.279},{"id":"game.bite.04","moment":"game.bite","text":"Pump fake, false alarm!","off":899312,"len":11013,"sec":1.481},{"id":"game.foul.01","moment":"game.foul","text":"Whistle! Mission paused.","off":910325,"len":10614,"sec":1.391},{"id":"game.foul.02","moment":"game.foul","text":"Hold the countdown. Whistle.","off":920939,"len":11605,"sec":1.637},{"id":"game.foul.03","moment":"game.foul","text":"Red light! There's a call.","off":932544,"len":10599,"sec":1.334},{"id":"game.foul.04","moment":"game.foul","text":"Stoppage. The tower is reviewing.","off":943143,"len":13090,"sec":1.951},{"id":"game.rival.make.01","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Incoming score. Stay on course.","off":956233,"len":13344,"sec":1.996},{"id":"game.rival.make.02","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Opponents on the board. Refocus.","off":969577,"len":14148,"sec":2.148},{"id":"game.rival.make.03","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Their launch lands. Respond!","off":983725,"len":12276,"sec":1.763},{"id":"game.rival.make.04","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Scored on. Shields back up!","off":996001,"len":12154,"sec":1.724},{"id":"game.rival.make.05","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Other side docks one. Stay steady.","off":1008155,"len":14079,"sec":2.191},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.01","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Their rocket reached the rim!","off":1022234,"len":11109,"sec":1.478},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.02","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Heavy landing, other side. Answer back!","off":1033343,"len":14274,"sec":2.244},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.03","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"They found altitude. Your turn next.","off":1047617,"len":13967,"sec":2.104},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.04","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Thrown down from orbit! Regroup!","off":1061584,"len":13098,"sec":1.881},{"id":"game.run.01","moment":"game.run","text":"Unanswered buckets! This mission is on autopilot!","off":1074682,"len":17483,"sec":3.038},{"id":"game.run.02","moment":"game.run","text":"Scoring streak! Orbit cannot look away!","off":1092165,"len":14523,"sec":2.193},{"id":"game.run.03","moment":"game.run","text":"Three straight and climbing! Keep the engines lit!","off":1106688,"len":15486,"sec":2.551},{"id":"game.run.04","moment":"game.run","text":"Nobody is answering! Full thrust run!","off":1122174,"len":14106,"sec":2.288},{"id":"game.point.us.01","moment":"game.point","text":"Game point! One bucket from touchdown!","tags":["side:us"],"off":1136280,"len":13960,"sec":2.159},{"id":"game.point.them.01","moment":"game.point","text":"Their game point. Hold the line, cadet!","tags":["side:them"],"off":1150240,"len":14146,"sec":2.178},{"id":"game.win.01","moment":"game.win","text":"That is the game! Touchdown, and the run is yours!","off":1164386,"len":16300,"sec":2.695},{"id":"game.win.02","moment":"game.win","text":"Game winner! Into the flight log!","off":1180686,"len":12572,"sec":1.77},{"id":"game.win.03","moment":"game.win","text":"Ballgame! Our cadet runs this orbit!","off":1193258,"len":14187,"sec":2.152},{"id":"game.win.04","moment":"game.win","text":"Final bucket lands! Victory at Orbit!","off":1207445,"len":15324,"sec":2.541},{"id":"game.loss.01","moment":"game.loss","text":"Their run. Refuel, cadet, and check back in.","off":1222769,"len":15604,"sec":2.535},{"id":"game.loss.02","moment":"game.loss","text":"Game goes to the other side. Good run, though.","off":1238373,"len":15365,"sec":2.5},{"id":"game.loss.03","moment":"game.loss","text":"Rough re-entry. Orbit still wants the rematch.","off":1253738,"len":16132,"sec":2.676},{"id":"game.draw.01","moment":"game.draw","text":"Equal power at the horn! Two crews, perfectly even.","off":1269870,"len":17750,"sec":3.087},{"id":"game.draw.02","moment":"game.draw","text":"Even at the buzzer! Share the sky tonight.","off":1287620,"len":14375,"sec":2.197},{"id":"game.assist.01","moment":"game.assist","text":"What a feed! Delivered!","off":1301995,"len":10368,"sec":1.359},{"id":"game.assist.02","moment":"game.assist","text":"Perfect handoff to the crew!","off":1312363,"len":11625,"sec":1.557},{"id":"game.assist.03","moment":"game.assist","text":"Coordinates sent! Bucket!","off":1323988,"len":11689,"sec":1.615},{"id":"game.assist.04","moment":"game.assist","text":"Guided it right in!","off":1335677,"len":10052,"sec":1.2},{"id":"game.alleyoop.01","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Alley-oop! Up and slammed!","off":1345729,"len":11181,"sec":1.462},{"id":"game.alleyoop.02","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Lob up, and liftoff!","off":1356910,"len":10600,"sec":1.393},{"id":"game.alleyoop.03","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Midair rendezvous! Beautiful!","off":1367510,"len":11396,"sec":1.563},{"id":"game.clock.01","moment":"game.clock","text":"Ten seconds! Countdown is live!","off":1378906,"len":13087,"sec":1.955},{"id":"game.clock.02","moment":"game.clock","text":"Final ten! Every second counts!","off":1391993,"len":12938,"sec":1.949},{"id":"game.clock.03","moment":"game.clock","text":"Clock is burning, ten seconds!","off":1404931,"len":12311,"sec":1.727},{"id":"game.overdrive.01","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Overdrive! The whole crew is synced!","off":1417242,"len":13072,"sec":1.89},{"id":"game.overdrive.02","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Hyperdrive engaged! Full crew thrust!","off":1430314,"len":14799,"sec":2.43},{"id":"game.overdrive.03","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"All engines, full power!","off":1445113,"len":11244,"sec":1.54}]}